WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.510
You two get somewhere safe!

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.430
Right. Let's go, Elfnein-chan.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.360
Miku!

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.440
We'll talk later.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.980
Yeah... You be careful, Hibiki.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:25.920
Tsubasa-san?

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.950
Tsubasa... What happened?

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.940
Why?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.940
Why aren't they picking up?

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:08.420
No... Miku and Elfnein-chan...

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:55.480
<b>
Episode 6
Xenoglossia</b>

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.750
No bodies have been reported in the vicinity.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:05.850
No injuried patients have been 
brought into any local hospitals.

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.530
But with all that blood...

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.760
Please widen the search area.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:13.920
Roger.

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:22.960
This was done carefully. Thoroughly.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:33.210
<i>It doesn't look like this 
was a coincidence...</i>

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:37.840
Yes. We should assume we've 
fallen for an enemy trap.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.270
<i>Two people whose protection 
level was at maximum...</i>

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.410
An alchemist from our backup staff...

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.580
And a girl who could possibly 
serve as vessel to a god...

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:53.160
Our intelligence unit was 
responsible for protecting them.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.120
But the inspection had them 
temporarily shut down.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:02.660
The enemy was after Miku-kun, 
or possibly Elfnein-kun... Or...

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.850
<i>It's possible that they wanted both.</i>

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.030
Either way, what we need now is information.

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.740
Keep looking for them, 
so we can get out of this mess.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:17.120
<i>Forensics will have their report in soon.</i>

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.000
<i>Intelligence will do everything it can.</i>

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.800
Both of you, please be safe.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.870
Thank you, Chris-chan.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:43.540
You know, I'm not really surprised. 
We knew it was a diversion!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:47.210
If we'd just ignored the 
orders we'd been given...

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:52.670
Tsukuyomi and Akatsuki, are you 
trying to say that I made a bad call?

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.460
No...

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.590
Then what—

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.250
Enough!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.810
She's got more of a right 
to freak out than anybody,

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:04.060
but she's trying her best to do her job.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.760
Please, Senpai.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.740
Tsubasa-san...

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.340
What's wrong? This isn't like you.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.220
Wait!

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:20.680
We're not done.

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:27.170
Something seems wrong...

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.930
Her heart's been torn into pieces.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:34.240
Yeah, but don't get upset at her.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.150
She understands this.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:40.020
You don't need to tell me!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:54.070
We're using the restraints to contain the 
uncontrolled energy from the bracelet...

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.420
Now we can...

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.480
<i>Vanessa and Millaarc have returned.</i>

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.460
<i>The guests are with them.</i>

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.990
Excellent.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.290
Preparations are going well here.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.090
Let's get to work.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:10.920
<i>Roger!</i>

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:16.870
The power of the gods will 
give us our future back.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.270
<i>I know it's my fault.</i>

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.360
<i>When I'm taking it out on the others... 
When I'm failing to protect the weak...</i>

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.040
This is Tsubasa.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.050
I heard. You've failed, haven't you?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.510
<i>I'm terribly sorry.</i>

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:43.780
<i>But, next time, I will 
fulfill my duty as a protector!</i>

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.250
Seal control.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:51.990
<i>Tsubasa, is this your true battlefield?</i>

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.530
<i>What can you protect there?</i>

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.270
<i>What can you truly defend?</i>

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.830
<i>If you ever feel lost, then visit.</i>

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:07.540
Never forget that you have the 
blood of the Kazanari within you,

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:12.390
and that the Ame no Habakiri is to be used
 as a sword to defeat threats to Japan.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.030
My war... isn't here?

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:25.950
Kanade...

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:29.420
<i>We will now have an emergency meeting.</i>

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.250
<i>Symphogear Wielders, please come 
to the command room immediately.</i>

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.220
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.980
Tsubasa, what were you doing?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.220
I'm sorry.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.740
We will now hold a meeting 
to discuss how we're going to

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:53.860
recover Miku-kun and Elfnein-kun, 
based on the latest reports.

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:55.670
Forensics revealed

00:07:55.670 --> 00:08:02.030
that the blood at the scene did not 
belong to either Miku-san or Elfnein-san.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.040
Then the two of them are...

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.750
Yes. With no reports of 
their bodies being found,

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:15.520
we believe that they were kidnapped 
by the enemy, not murdered.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.410
It's not time to rejoice yet.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:27.200
But still, we have hope!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:32.890
But then... whose blood 
was all over the ground?

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:35.150
We're still investigating that.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:39.280
We will now shift our operations towards 
getting the two of them back...

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.570
U-Um, may I say something?

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:47.090
I can understand why they'd want to 
kidnap an alchemist like Elfnein.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.890
But why Miku-san, too?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.340
Commander...

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.900
As for why Miku-kun was involved in this,

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:59.480
and was kidnapped rather than harmed...

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:04.010
It may be time for you to hear our theory.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:07.940
Miku...

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.390
Is this...

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.160
Welcome home, Master!

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.130
You!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:33.520
I always wanted to say that 
when I came to Japan...

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.980
Is this the Château...

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.660
You can't do that! We need to 
treat our guests with respect.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.950
I will, next time.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.810
Hmph.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.240
<i>I have to think...</i>

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:50.550
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:54.180
<i>What happened on my way here?</i>

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:01.310
Elfnein-chan!

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.420
Are you okay?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.790
Elfnein's the clumsy one, right?

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:11.410
Still, you kept me running 
for a good, long while.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:14.590
I won't let you touch my friend!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.580
No, Miku-san!

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:22.810
I didn't think I could get you 
outside of HQ this easily.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.390
What are you doing here?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:29.520
I was only ordered to grab Elfnein.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:34.150
Now, I can't decide what 
to do with you on my own.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.410
Vanessa?

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.730
<i>I have a message for you, Millaarc-chan.</i>

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.680
Run, Elfnein-chan!

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.270
No, Miku-san.

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.480
Yeah, roger.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.620
Don't blame me for this.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.910
Elfnein-chan!

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.570
Miku-san, run!

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:59.270
You never get to see scenes 
like this on TV anymore,

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:02.020
and my body can't control itself!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.470
Miku-san, run!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:11.390
I didn't expect to see the 
sky... looking like that.

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.340
That's right. Miku-san...

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.410
Where is Miku-san?

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.490
Miku-san!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.580
Unlike that man, who was
 of no further use to us,

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:40.390
she is still alive.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.590
We've left her alive.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:47.590
You're going to use her because she's 
been released from the Curse of Balal?

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.370
That's right!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:54.230
And you've got work to do, too.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.520
We want you to use Carol's body,

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.690
which you currently possess, 
to activate something for us.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.170
Carol's body?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.710
The Château de Tiffauges?

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.320
Impossible!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:11.660
Even if you activate it, the Yantra Sarvaswa 
and the left arm of the Nephilim are gone.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.450
It's impossible to control it...

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.180
Calm down.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:17.800
That's not it.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:21.420
What we want you to activate is this.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.500
It looks like some kind of generator.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.240
Wh-What is this?

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:45.460
What are you plotting?

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.790
<i>How far am I going to fall?</i>

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:58.890
<i>I need to do something, or Hibiki will worry.</i>

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:03.840
<i>That's right! I need to make up with Hibiki!</i>

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.660
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:18.980
<i>This incident, in which we allowed
 non-combatants to be harmed...</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.460
<i>It was a big shock, I'm sure.</i>

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.120
<i>Who could have known</i>

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.460
<i>that the two who were struck by the light 
of Shenshoujin were released from original sin,</i>

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:32.530
<i>and became potential vessels 
for the power of a god...</i>

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.800
<i>Everybody accepted this,</i>

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:39.070
<i>and is trying their best to 
overcome it with a strong heart.</i>

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.410
I'm no good...

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:52.450
Tsubasa's frustrated and I can't 
even reach out a hand to her.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:14:00.240
I had fights with Serena, too...

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:05.710
<i>The apple floated in the sky</i>

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:14.200
<i>The apple fell down to the ground</i>

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.840
<i>The stars were born</i>

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:23.490
<i>The songs were born</i>

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.490
There were always songs 
flowing between us...

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:32.160
<i>The Ruru Amel smiled for eternity</i>

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.310
We didn't need words to 
make up with each other.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.400
This phrase... I've heard it 
somewhere recently, I think.

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:41.180
The results of our investigation are inside.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.850
Thank you.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.570
I'm heading back with the evidence.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.300
Doubts are one thing,

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:03.920
but having anything that's proof 
brought back to their HQ could be bad.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.600
Please listen closely.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:10.620
<i>We've detected S.O.N.G. movements 
through our observation network.</i>

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.060
<i>They seem to have discovered 
the relationship between us</i>

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.540
<i>and the Kazanari Organization, too.</i>

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.730
<i>What do we do?</i>

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.490
You know where they're at, right?

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:21.440
Then there's no need to hesitate.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.530
You're right, aren't you?

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:28.290
Seeing as I'm the big sister, 
I guess I'll have to go on the offensive.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:37.290
<i>We'll work on manifesting 
the power of a god.</i>

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.950
<i>You handle your part.</i>

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.060
<i>Are you certain?</i>

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:48.550
Our lab's analysis revealed that the item
 we recovered from the waste dump

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:53.680
has a 119.6% chance of 
being the Antikythera Gear.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:59.540
So numbers are so high that 
we look like we're lying, huh?

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:04.630
<i>A relic lost in the earlier incident 
is discovered at the enemy's HQ...</i>

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:09.510
We didn't receive any reports indicating
 that what they were storing was stolen.

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:13.620
If we assume they only pretended it was lost
 and instead sent it somewhere else...

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.550
Ever since the passage of the DDLPN law,

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:19.150
the Kazanari Organization has 
been in charge of all the relics.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:25.140
As you feared, there's some connection 
between Kamakura and Noble Red...

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.010
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:27.960
Enemy attack!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.920
They are likely to be after the evidence!

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:41.300
Aw, and here I was trying 
to show you a good time!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.750
<i>We have reinforcements on the way!</i>

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.110
<i>Keep her off you until they arrive!</i>

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.310
That's the plan!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:07.920
I won't let you!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.760
Switch on! Collider!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.590
<b>Ninja Technique: Car Clone</b>

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.300
What the hell?

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.460
Modern ninja techniques?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:39.350
<i>Killiter Ichaival tron.</i>

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.530
Bang!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.490
<i>The smell of gunpowder and 
smoke tickles the nose</i>

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:33.870
<i>The clatter of empty gun cartridges</i>

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.160
What?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.040
<i>Ichaival and Airgetlám 
have engaged the enemy.</i>

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:39.510
<i>Anybody who's in love with 
the sight of my red heels</i>

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.420
You're wide open!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:44.210
<i>and wants a bullet in the brain, raise your hand</i>

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:49.180
<i>Even if I shed blood, even if I'm hurt</i>

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:56.500
<i>The winds of time and the bonds 
I have with my companions</i>

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.240
She keeps using cowardly tactics!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:01.470
<i>Will erase the pain and turn it into a scab</i>

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:02.960
Ogawa-san has left the combat area.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.500
<i>It's so warm!</i>

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.710
The enemy Noble Red is on the move, 
standing on top of a civilian car.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:11.350
<i>Just live your life at 120%</i>

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:09.220
I failed to eliminate the evidence.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:13.320
I guess the most I can 
do is delay the Wielders.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:22.020
<i>If you do, a better past and future 
will always be in your hands (Fire)</i>

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.330
Are you planning on letting 
more innocents die?

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.080
Yup!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.890
I won't let you!

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:24.490
<i>A doubt? A stupid question (Fire)</i>

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.100
<i>No need for introductions (Fire)</i>

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.940
So that's the Airgetlám...

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:34.770
<i>Taste a bullet from the girl 
whose whole body is a weapon</i>

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.740
I'm amazed that you and your little sister

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.030
were able to wear that light 
without doubting anything.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.280
What does that mean?

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:40.240
One of the relics recovered by the 
US military during the Iraq war.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.290
A mysterious gear, 
unlike Igalima and Shul-Shagana,

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:49.040
given a name of convenience 
because its origin was unknown...

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:52.510
Just kidding!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.320
It's another one of her tricks!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.760
Don't let her throw you off your game!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.240
Yeah, you're right!

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.400
We'll stop you here!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.630
Show me the end of the world!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.020
Okay, how about this?

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.390
You take her!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.100
Roger!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:37.130
People died because you failed.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:42.250
<i>I've come far enough to pull 
along the hand that holds my own</i>

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:41.140
What?

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:44.130
But it's still a weak point for you!

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:46.970
<i>An honest, foolish futurism</i>

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:52.990
<i>The histories that came 
together will guide us (Fire)</i>

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:55.480
<i>Output to full (Fire)</i>

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.060
<i>Locked on (Fire)</i>

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.350
Your aim is way off.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:01.580
<i>Let it go, let loose</i>

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:06.610
<i>Take everything that I've got!</i>

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.440
Put your hands up.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:20.710
Tell us where you're hiding Miku and Elfnein.

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:22.720
What?

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:28.950
The Château de Tiffauges?

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.950
Materialize?

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.980
